  "display_title": "A Better Labor",
  "description": "After the great explosion, the world could never return to what it once was. Divided into small countries driven by specialized labor forces, it's now a dog-eat-dog new world. But Clawhammer Jang listens to more than just his stomach. As he pushes forward, he joins forces with others, new friends also gifted with immense power following the aftermath of the great explosion. But is Jang strong enough to stand for what he believes in? And who will stand with him?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
